# =========================================================================
# orch_crew_arena.tcyr — a crew that lives in an arena costs nothing for good (ADR 028).
#
# No oracle test block: Rust frees on drop. These pin what agnostic's 2.2.4 report asked
# for, measured the way it measured: a loop of crews, then `alloc_used()`. A crew built
# with `agnosai_crew_new_in`, run and released must leave the global heap where it found
# it, in every process mode, with a model answering and failing, so a bare `alloc` on the
# crew path fails here and not in a long-lived consumer.
#
# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.
# =========================================================================

